    "text": "The value of <math> <mrow> <msub> <mrow> <mtext>log</mtext></mrow> <mrow> <mtext>10</mtext></mrow> </msub> <mtext> </mtext><mtext>K</mtext></mrow> </math> for a reaction <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> is<br />\r(Given <math><mo>∆</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>298</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>54.07</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math><br />\r<math><mo>∆</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>298</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and<br />\r<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8.314</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi math